es of freedom and a modal basis of small dimension. 5 Verification The features and the methods presented in this document are verified by the following test cases: | SDNS01 | Non-parametric–parametric probabilistic model of a plate in bending with localised impact non-linearities | V5.06.001 | | --- | --- | --- | | SHLS200 | Non-parametric probabilistic model: Harmonic response of a substructured plate | V2.06.200 | 6 Bibliography 1. CAMBIER S., DESCELIERS C.: Non-parametric–parametric probabilistic model of a plate in bending with localised impact non-linearities, Code_Aster documentation V5.06.001. 2. CAMBIER S., DESCELIERS C.: Monte Carlo numerical simulation, Code_Aster documentation U2.08.05. 3. CAMBIER S., DESCELIERS C.: Operator GENE_VARI_ALEA, Code_Aster documentation U4.36.06. 4. CAMBIER S., DESCELIERS C.: Operator GENE_MATR_ALEA, Code_Aster documentation U4.36.07. 5. CAMBIER S., DESCELIERS C., SOIZE S.: Probabilistic taking into account of uncertainties in the estimation of the seismic behaviour of a primary circuit, Note EDF-R&D HT‑62/03/005/A, 2003 6. CAMBIER S., DESCELIERS C., SOIZE S.: Probabilistic taking into account of uncertainties in the estimation of the seismic behaviour of a primary circuit. 7th National AFPS Colloquium, 2003. 7. CAMBIER S.: Application of the probabilistic approach to the fuel assembly within the framework of the "3% AMA" in 2002, CR-AMA-03-004, December 2002 8. CAMBIER S.: Probabilistic approach for taking into account the scatter of mechanical parameters - Application to vibratory fatigue, Note EDF-R&D HT-64/00/040/A, December 2000 9. CAMBIER S., GUIHOT P., COFFIGNAL G. : Computational methods for accounting of structural uncertainties, applications to dynamic behaviour prediction of piping systems. Structural Safety, 24: 29-50, 2002. 10. CHEBLI H.: Modelling of non-homogeneous Random Uncertainties in Structural Dynamics for the Low-Frequency Domain Thesis CNAM-ONERA, 2002 11. DESCELIERS C., SOIZE C., CAMBIER S. : Nonparame